@startuml
title E Visa Processing And Follow Up System - UML State Machine Diagram

state AccountCreation <<choice>>
state Login <<choice>>
state Application <<choice>>
state Payment <<choice>>
state Accepted <<choice>>
state StatusView <<choice>>
state StatusCheck <<choice>>
state Cancellation <<choice>>
state DetailsModification <<choice>>
state DetailsView <<choice>>
state FeedbackGiving <<choice>>
state Logout <<choice>>
state PurposeView <<choice>>

AccountCreation -[*]> Login
Login -.-> Application: After login
Application -.-> Payment: After application submission
Payment -.-> Accepted: After successful payment
Accepted -.-> StatusView: After acceptance
StatusView -.-> StatusCheck: To check status
StatusCheck -.-> Checked: After checking status
Checked -.-> FeedbackGiving: If feedback is given
FeedbackGiving -.-> Logout: After giving feedback
Logout -.-> AccountCreation: After logout
PurposeView -.-> ApprovedOrRejected: Based on document check
ApprovedOrRejected -.-> StatusUpdate: Update status after approval or rejection

@enduml
